  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><title>Warm Up Activity</title>
<para>You will be asked to evaluate the percentage of a number mentally. Sometimes, a visual is helpful to do this. If needed, use the GeoGebra activity to help you determine the requested values. Then, look for a pattern that can be used to describe how to find the percentage of any number. </para>
<div class="os-raise-d-flex-nowrap os-raise-justify-content-center">
  <iframe><iframe scrolling="no" src="https://www.geogebra.org/material/iframe/id/XSFd8GkK/width/1035/height/468/border/888888/sfsb/true/smb/false/stb/false/stbh/false/ai/false/asb/false/sri/false/rc/false/ld/false/sdz/false/ctl/false" title="Copy of Percentage of an Amount (1%)"> </iframe></iframe>
</div>
<div class="os-raise-ib-pset" data-button-text="Check" data-content-id="c236b5d6-eed6-429c-b665-bb4506fc08c5" data-fire-learning-opportunity-event="eventnameY" data-fire-success-event="eventnameX" data-retry-limit="0" data-schema-version="1.0">
  <exercise><problem/><solution/></exercise>
  <exercise data-content-id="89acbc05-bc17-40cb-9872-c5ce8a7fb71f" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="50">
    <problem>
      <para> What is 25% of 200? </para>
      <para> Enter your answer here: </para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para> Correct! 50</para>
    </solution>
    </exercise>
  <exercise data-content-id="7b37d976-9dba-4f13-af94-03b694dd688f" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="24">
    <problem>
      <para> What is 12% of 200? </para>
      <para> Enter your answer here: </para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para> Correct! 24</para>
    </solution>
    </exercise>
  <exercise data-content-id="dd65ceb4-46ec-46c7-830f-cdeeec095223" data-problem-comparator="integer" data-problem-type="input" data-solution="16">
    <problem>
      <para> What is 8% of 200? </para>
      <para> Enter your answer here: </para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para> Correct! 16</para>
    </solution>
    </exercise>
